I just tested fighting a couple of chameleons in wizard mode with a
stethoscope,
and it seems like when the chameleon transforms it remains at about
the
same percentage of Max HP than it was before the transformation. So
a sasquatch that was at 8/36 turned into a fire elemental at 9/42, a
tiger
that was at 5/10 turned into a dog at 3/6, and so on. Since minotaurs
are lower level than titans, the chameleon might've lost HP when
transforming
from a titan to a minotaur. And if it was really beat up and then
rolled
poorly on its cure self (3d6 cure, I think), maybe a good hit with +2
Magicbane
at expert level would be enough to kill it? I haven't read the source,
though,
so take this for what it's worth. (Also, I was testing in vanilla;
don't know if
it's different in Spork.)

